    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d593">

                <pb facs="0587" n="1321" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1321"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-08"><hi rendition="#italic">October 8, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received Oct. 25.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 639.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my telegram of this date, I
                    have the honor to call your attention to the inclosed dispatch, No. 84, from
                    Consul Gibson to Consul-General Short of the 1st instant, calling his attention
                    to missionary apprehensions of a massacre in the interior.</p>
                <pb facs="0588" n="1322" xml:id="pg1322"/>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>The danger now seems so serious in the vilayets of Aleppo and Adana that I would
                    advise the removal of missionaries to the seacoast and ask refuge on the war
                    vessel of some friendly power whose boats are near, but believe that now the
                    danger would be greater for our people while in transitu than if they remained
                    calmly at their posts.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d593-a1.xml" xpointer="d593-a1"/>
            </div>
